WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.500
Somewhere between where we are and where we’re going, there’s a seat to share.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:20.500
Ridly brings passengers and drivers together for the trips already happening.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:35.500
Start with a destination, a familiar place, or a search you’ve made before.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:52.500
Choose where and when. Browse available rides, dates, seats, and prices in one place.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:01:07.500
Get to know the trip and the person driving before you book.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:17.500
And if the right ride isn’t there yet, ask Ridly to let you know when one appears.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:31.500
For drivers, getting started means adding your car and the number passengers can use to pay you directly.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:52.500
Offer a regular commute that keeps rolling, or post a one-off journey with a minimum number of passengers.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:02:07.500
Keep trips up to date, see who’s coming, and close the loop when the journey is done.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:23.500
Plans can change. Stay in touch about the booking, keep track of updates, and build trust through profiles and ratings.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:40.500
After the ride, passengers pay the driver directly through MobilePay. Both sides can keep the settlement status clear.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:51.500
Then leave a rating. Drivers can also review monthly earnings and download an annual tax report.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.000
Different journeys. One seat closer.
